  "$comment": "Blender-built food stalls and vending machines (tools/art/blender/families/stalls.py). Replaces the primitive-part placeholders of tools/art/community.py by key; listed in the base manifest's packs. The placeholder is kept as a fallback if a file fails to load, and the materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. The ice cream cart slides its freezer lid open and the hot dog stand lifts its hot-plate lid (`lid_open`); a snack and a can drop to the machines' trays (`drop`). Each has a far version for the town overview.",
  "version": 1,
